### Backend API tests for VS Code.
### Install the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client), then click "Send Request" above any request.
### Start both services first (Terminal > Run Task... > "Start backend + voice service").

@backend = http://localhost:8080
@voice = http://localhost:8000

### Is everything up? (database + voice service)
GET {{backend}}/api/health

### Voice service directly (should say "status": "ok"; asr_backend should be faster_whisper)
GET {{voice}}/health


########## 1. Turn a sentence into a draft (nothing is saved) ##########

### Arabic + English
POST {{backend}}/api/voice-expenses/parse-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "دفعت 150 جنيه في Uber امبارح"
}

### English, with a fixed reference time so "this morning" is predictable
POST {{backend}}/api/voice-expenses/parse-text
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I paid 80 pounds for coffee at Cilantro this morning",
  "reference_time": "2026-11-27T14:00:00+02:00"
}

### A recording. Put an audio file (.m4a .mp3 .wav .ogg .webm) next to this file and change the two names below.
### Easier: open http://localhost:8080/ and use the Record button (laptop microphone).
POST {{backend}}/api/voice-expenses/parse-audio
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----MasroofyBoundary

------MasroofyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="recording.m4a"
Content-Type: audio/mp4

< ./recording.m4a
------MasroofyBoundary--


########## 2. Confirm a draft = save it in PostgreSQL ##########
### "draft" is normally the whole JSON returned by parse-text / parse-audio (copy it in).
### "corrections" holds only the fields the user changed. Response 201 = saved.

POST {{backend}}/api/voice-expenses/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "draft": {
    "transaction_type": "expense",
    "amount": 150.0,
    "currency": "EGP",
    "merchant": "Uber",
    "category": "transport",
    "date": "2026-11-26",
    "payment_method": "unknown",
    "transcript": "دفعت 150 جنيه في Uber امبارح",
    "language": "mixed",
    "reference_time": "2026-11-27T20:58:00+02:00"
  },
  "corrections": {
    "amount": "160",
    "payment_method": "card"
  }
}

### Confirm without an amount -> 422 amount_required (nothing saved)
POST {{backend}}/api/voice-expenses/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "draft": {
    "amount": null,
    "date": "2026-11-26",
    "transcript": "دفعت في Uber",
    "reference_time": "2026-11-27T20:58:00+02:00"
  }
}


########## 3. Saved transactions ##########

### Add one without voice (only amount is required)
POST {{backend}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 85.5,
  "merchant": "Cilantro",
  "category": "food_dining",
  "date": "2026-11-27",
  "time": "09:10",
  "payment_method": "cash"
}

### Income
POST {{backend}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_type": "income",
  "amount": 12000,
  "note": "salary"
}

### List (newest first). Optional: from, to, category, type, limit
GET {{backend}}/api/transactions?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30

### Monthly totals per currency and per category
GET {{backend}}/api/transactions/summary?month=2026-11

### One transaction (change the id)
GET {{backend}}/api/transactions/1

### Edit (change the id). Fields you leave out get their defaults, except date, which stays the same.
PUT {{backend}}/api/transactions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 170,
  "merchant": "Uber",
  "category": "transport",
  "payment_method": "card"
}

### Delete (change the id) -> 204
DELETE {{backend}}/api/transactions/1

### Allowed category ids
GET {{backend}}/api/transactions/categories


########## 4. Errors (all have {"error_code", "message"}) ##########

### 422 validation_error
POST {{backend}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -5,
  "payment_method": "visa"
}

### 422 invalid_field (unknown category)
POST {{backend}}/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5,
  "category": "food"
}

### 404 not_found
GET {{backend}}/api/transactions/999999
